# Python Standards

- Prefer repo **`.venv`** (`uv sync --group dev`); do not `pip install` dbt into system Python.
- Type hints on signatures/returns; `structlog` for app logs (avoid `print()` in prod paths).
- Dataclasses/Pydantic for validated event/schema models.
- Handle I/O explicitly (files, S3, Kafka, Redshift, Airflow APIs).
- Pytest fixtures over large inline setup; keep tests deterministic (seeds, stable UUIDs, temp dirs).
- No magic strings for topics/tables/layers/env keys — shared constants or config.

## Kafka Producers

- Build configs via `ingestion/kafka/msk_config.py`.
- Reliability defaults: `acks=all`, idempotence, retries, delivery timeout, batching, `lz4`.
- Align payloads with `ingestion/schemas/` and `ingestion/kafka/topics.py`.
- Entity IDs from `ingestion/kafka/sim_entities.py` (`STORE-*`, `PROD-*`, `LOYAL-*`).
- Only `clickstream_producer.py` and `inventory_producer.py` are active; POS is batch (`ingestion/batch/generate_pos_parquet.py`).

## Local Helpers (`local-testing-version` branch)

- Iceberg → DuckDB: `scripts/local/load_iceberg_to_duckdb.py` (local branch only).
- POS local Parquet: `python -m ingestion.batch.generate_pos_parquet --output-dir ...`.
- POS cloud upload: `generate_pos_parquet.py --output-s3 s3://<bronze>/iceberg/bronze/pos_transactions/` (boto3 lazy-imported).
- Unit tests: `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests/unit/ -q`.

## Tests

- Prefer static contracts for Airflow/Flink when importing runtimes needs heavy deps.
- Integration DuckDB identity checks: `tests/integration/verify_local_identity.py` (seeds mode).
